# Central Electrica 1F (C7, contract 53), 28 x 22, interior. Reached by surfing the lake of Ruta 10 to the plant's facade (`central_gate`): the way in is (13..14,21) -> Ruta 10 `lake_gate`. The look (the user's mock CENTRAL): BIG
# steel plates of 2 x 2 tiles (the gym floor's `metal_<i%2><j%2>`), cable walls on the back sides, rows of animated GENERATORS (an arc jumps between two posts), transformers, floor cables and pylons; the wild-encounter tiles are scorched plates with a bolt crack
# (`spark_<i%2><j%2>`, C_GRASS). Four engineers / a punk (static art: their lines of sight follow the rows and columns), three items, a sign; the stairs (13,2) go up to the roost.
@map central_electrica
@size 28 22
@interior yes
@area central_electrica
@bg 3
@fill metal_00
@encounters grass rate=11
  spoolt 36 40 5
  zaphid 36 40 20
  voltspool 38 42 25
  coilisp 36 40 5
  hoodcoil 38 42 15
  voltaboon 42 44 10
  coilet 36 40 15
  teslarch 40 44 5
@end
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 2 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 2 table=grass area=abcdghijlm period=1800
@spawn door 13 19 N
@spawn up 13 3 S
